{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0011","type":"heading","page":1,"text":"Brief Profile :","bbox":null,"level":4,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Mallikharjuna Rao K is currently serving as Assistant Professor (Grade-I) in the Department of Data Science and Artificial Intelligence at the International Institute of Information Technology (IIIT), Naya Raipur, Chhattisgarh, India.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0013","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Prior to this position, he worked as an Assistant Professor (Senior Grade-I) at VIT-AP University, Andhra Pradesh (2019–2021). He also served as an Associate Professor at Shri Vishnu Engineering College for Women, Bhimavaram (2018–2019). Earlier, he was associated with GITAM University, Visakhapatnam (2011–2018) and Gokaraju Rangaraju Institute of Engineering and Technology, Hyderabad (2007–2011) as an Assistant Professor.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0014","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Rao received his Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering (2018) and M.Tech. in Computer Science (2010) from Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University Hyderabad (JNTUH). He earned his B.Tech. in Information Science and Technology from Acharya Nagarjuna University, Andhra Pradesh, in 2004.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0015","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He has successfully secured research funding, including a grant of ₹6 lakhs from the Department of Science and Technology (DST), Government of India, for organizing a National Workshop on Data Science Research at GITAM University, and ₹3.69 lakhs from NTPC Ltd. for research activities at IIIT Naya Raipur.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0016","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Rao has published over 60 research papers in reputed international journals and conferences. He holds one Indian granted patent and has two published Indian patents to his credit.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0017","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"He served as an editorial board member and reviewer for several reputed SCI/WoS/Scopus-indexed journals, including IET Software, IEEE Sensors Journal, CMBBE, IJSAEM, JCS, JSR, IJECE, IJCS, BEEI, and IJSER. He has also chaired technical sessions at major international conferences, including IEEE WIECON-ECE 2022, ICCIDE 2022, and TRIBES 2021. Additionally, he has served as a Technical Program Committee (TPC) member and reviewer for various Springer and IEEE conferences, including WCAIC 2023, ICDSA 2023, CVR 2023, InC4 2023, ICCCT 2023, TENSYMP 2022, AIC 2022, and ICCIS 2022.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0018","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Rao is a Senior Member of IEEE, including IEEE Computational Intelligence Society (CIS) and IEEE Computer Society (CS), and a Life Member of the Computer Society of India (CSI).","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
{"id":"faculty-mallikharjuna_rao_k:e0019","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"His research interests include Artificial Intelligence, particularly Evolutionary Algorithms, Swarm Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Science, Data Mining, Data Privacy, Imbalanced Data Learning, and their applications in healthcare and finance.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
